# Ignore invisible
.*
*~
!.gitignore
!.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc
coverage/
!.github

# Host-local recovery artefacts (Issue #211). run.sh now writes these outside
# docs/, but a host still on an older run.sh writes them here — and the
# heartbeat stages the whole docs/ tree, so ignore them explicitly.
# Note: an ignore rule has no effect on an already-tracked path, so the
# docs/index.json.bak committed before this change stays in the tree until the
# history compaction removes it. This stops it being re-added once it is gone.
docs/index.json.bak
docs/index.json.corrupted.*
# Belt and braces for log staging files. copy_log_tail stages at
# docs/<HOST>/.node-<user>.log.tmp.<pid>, which the `.*` rule above already
# covers; this catches an un-hidden staging name should that ever change, so a
# crash between the write and the rename cannot strand a committable file.
*.log.tmp.*
